# This recipe reads credentials from the nearest .env, walking up from this
# folder -- by default that's agents-cookbook/.env at the cookbook root, so
# one paste there covers every recipe. Copy this file to a local .env in
# THIS folder only if you want to override the shared config for this
# recipe specifically.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Fallback for the Reflexion and Plan-and-Solve demos (deliberately Haiku --
# both are testing a fast/cheap model's failure-and-recovery behavior, which
# is exactly where this kind of scaffolding earns its keep). The ReWOO and
# ReAct demos hardcode claude-sonnet-5 in code, because planning a multi-step
# tool sequence needs more than Haiku-tier reasoning -- see the recipe README.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
